{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ET9SuZrPBU1794390817.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地最大中藥飲片企業之一，新荷花首日掛牌造好。</p><p></p><p>收報69元，較招股價40.2元，高七成一。以每手50股，不計手續費，一手帳面賺1,440元。</p><p></p><p>股份公開發售部分，錄得約2,190倍超額認購，一手中籤率百分之2.01，國際發售超購0.25倍，集資淨額近2億元，用於擴大產能和升級數字化智能生產系統等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.209732+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:37:41.606695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:50:08.213599+00:00","content_hash":"ab7b398c4efcb243da33523f23214f54f8846e6c895dcd200b4ceb9032cbad64","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.209732+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}